                "text": "Last week, our team also dropped a SIXTH bill!\n\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffd #SB5394 continues our efforts to grow opportunities for grads of intl. med schools. By allowing for more providers who better represent more of our communities, we can bolster our health care system & improve patient care. #WALeg https://t.co/1KdHPKFvFs",
