                "text": "\u26a0\ufe0fThe #KeepOurCareAct has a hearing 10:30 a.m. TOMORROW in Senate Law & Justice.\u26a0\ufe0f \n\n#SB5241 regulates hospital & health system mergers & protects access to secular health care, like reproductive & gender-affirming care.\n\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffdSign up to testify at the link in the comments. #WALeg https://t.co/0OJlH1hYEQ",
