                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Our bill reimbursing ARNPs & PAs at the same rate as physicians had a public hearing today! \ud83d\udea8  \n\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffd #SB5373 will strengthen our health care system so that neighbors can get the quality, affordable health care we all deserve. \n\nStay tuned for more updates! \ud83e\ude7a #WALeg https://t.co/ykDiy9UUlA",
