                "text": "Every single one of our neighbors deserves access to affordable, quality health care, period. This why I\u2019m sponsoring the #KeepOurCareAct, ensuring health entity mergers & acquisitions are driven by EXPANDING access to care, not eroding it.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nMore at the link in the comments. \ud83d\udc47\ud83c\udffd https://t.co/ky7vGCARvl",
